  <item>
    <title>Ep.17 建筑风水奇谈-香港上海篇：玄学还是设计？Ep.17</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/687dc2a8a9dec92500565ff0</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">687dc2a8a9dec92500565ff0</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 21 Jul 2025 22:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>主播：大脸猫，菠萝包</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期我们从香港80年代最有名的大楼风水战聊起，一路聊到00年代的上海，用真实故事和都市传说带你走进建筑设计背后的隐秘战场。</span></p><span></span><p><span>前半段用大白话说说“风水”这回事，后半段再用大白话说说现代艺术，这俩事不冲突！吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span>请大家订阅，并在小宇宙留言区和我们互动，告诉我们这个城市建筑故事系列下一期侧重哪个方向比较好，谢谢各位制作人的pick！❤️</span></p><span></span><p><span>你将听到：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="69">1:09</a> 什么是风水？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="798">13:18</a> 中银大厦图示：</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fmxw_y3yde9lhoDCUmdaeKIbfs9S.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1138">18:58</a> 汇丰银行及皇后像公园种树图示：</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkipZPhwBwBtQ_OjlY7tjM3FK7Lr.png"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1370">22:50</a> 铜狮子与石狮子：</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FubcPsTS5iGaGQmK1zNTZhx0zqzX.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgJE5d1YWoW9evELcf6sMB9xXber.png"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1485">24:45</a> 汇丰银行内部2-8楼环状大堂示意图：</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiODeiLqcau4Ut2wtz9R1e9oq8Wi.png"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1726">28:46</a> 竹节状的中银大厦图示：</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Flcg2yxR48uHUWAwhZ-yeA1H3Tkn.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2052">34:12</a> 汇丰银行的反制大炮：</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fsy01uPyJW92pMBPShgbwWTrTcbz.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2401">40:01</a> 长江大厦接化发图示：</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoKh9w9mU1oz6PbBrH1lvJWyk0qt.png"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2828">47:08</a> 上海厨房三件套：</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmT-Na2zdnPK1Cba-mqQDUhsuefM.png"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3028">50:28</a> 包豪斯风格：</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtLwyOyKbFDwNAz4969_mu5t2J72.webp"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3074">51:14</a> 后现代主义及波普艺术对于包豪斯的反抗：</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqUHoDYTLhg_PBloR9gcpXGavqKi.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3270">54:30</a> 上海环球金融中心设计演化：</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fjj6MWqwh-ckS_GJFEban-4UcvHU.jpeg"></figure>]]></description>
