  <item>
    <title>Ep. 15 九十年代的夏天是快乐的，现在的夏天是要命的！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/686186adbef90978ec848069</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">686186adbef90978ec848069</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 29 Jun 2025 23:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>主播：大脸猫，菠萝包</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>2025年真的热得不像话，我们决定用一整期节目，穿越回那个空调不舍得开、蜡烛照亮一整晚的90年代夏天。和我们一起重温两毛钱的老冰棍、对着风扇“啊啊啊”变声的傻乐、凉席压出的“花纹纹身”... 这期节目，我们把90年代的童年“土法避暑神技”全翻出来了！准备好，一起回到那个自带清凉BGM的夏天吧！</span></p><span></span><p><span>你将听到：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="145">2:25</a> </span><strong><span>建筑师们的“降温战”</span></strong><span>：美国同行如何用设计对抗碳排放？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="420">7:00</a> </span><strong><span>看不见的环保细节</span></strong><span>：为啥“防鸟撞玻璃”这么重要？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="710">11:50</a> </span><strong><span>球场变“烤炉”</span></strong><span>：世俱杯现场观众快被晒化了！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="837">13:57</a> </span><strong><span>驯龙高手</span></strong><span>：看电影为啥看得主包们汗毛倒立？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1012">16:52</a> </span><strong><span>时光机启动！</span></strong><span>和我们穿越回90年代吧</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1066">17:46</a> 90年代的窗式空调：</span></p><span></span><figure><br></figure><span></span><figure><br></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiO03MkHM-eC0IA0dtFhrBLcDgqH.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1193">19:53</a> 老式国产绿色风扇：</span></p><span></span><figure><br></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgAoe0eDWosGXUxHb4WoA6eAZT8d.webp"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1290">21:30</a> 老式鸿运风扇：</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fsh99BempIgR3ynwQaC97xdV_XVm.png"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1771">29:31</a> </span><strong><span>夏日里的一抹温柔：</span></strong><span>奶奶的蒲扇，蒲团，蒲棒，香蒲</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2020">33:40</a> </span><strong><span>防蚊秘笈：</span></strong><span>儿时都有哪些奇招妙招防蚊子？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2250">37:30</a> </span><strong><span>体育课的“烤”验：</span></strong><span>中美体育老师面对学生中暑，态度大不同？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2639">43:59</a> </span><strong><span>凉席上的烦恼：</span></strong><span>麻将块凉席，竹席，藤席都给主包们带来过什么困扰？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3174">52:54</a> </span><strong><span>天堂！童年雪糕大点兵：</span></strong><span>老冰棍，冰袋，棒棒冰，三色杯，大头，光明冰砖，绿色心情，冰工厂，小布丁，和路雪可爱多，美国提子，小雪人，巧乐兹，苦咖啡雪糕，这些好吃的雪糕你们还记得吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4247">1:10:47</a> </span><strong><span>奶茶店垄断之前百花齐放的冷饮摊们：</span></strong><span>糖水，冰室，凉茶店，炒冰，冷饮店，清补凉，杨枝甘露</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4760">1:19:20</a> </span><strong><span>水果系的夏日回忆：</span></strong><span>井水镇西瓜，甘蔗，盐水泡菠萝</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5302">1:28:22</a> </span><strong><span>物理降温小妙招：</span></strong><span>教室泼水，打水仗，滋水枪，野外游泳，还有哪些？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5913">1:38:33</a> </span><strong><span>夏天也是昆虫的季节：</span></strong><span>粘知了，掏蝉蛹，大蚂蚁，毛毛虫，天牛，螳螂</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6621">1:50:21</a> </span><strong><span>舌尖上的夏天：</span></strong><span>捻子果是什么？凉拌五毒又是什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="7149">1:59:09</a> </span><strong><span>感悟：</span></strong><span>前智能手机时代，我们是如何体验这个世界的？</span></p><span></span><p><span>最后希望大家都能享受夏天，请大家在小宇宙/苹果播客订阅我们，同时我们也登陆了喜马拉雅/网易云/YouTube</span></p><span></span><p><span>谢谢大家！</span></p>]]></description>
